            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.29.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "29:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka wa kpwandza wa utawala wa mfalume Koreshi wa Pashia, Mwenyezi Mlungu wamuhenda Koreshi mfalume wa Pashia aandike tangazo na ritangazwe kahi za ufalumewe wosi, ili neno ra Mwenyezi Mlungu rogombwa ni nabii Jeremia ritimiye. Tangazo renye kala rinaamba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho vilongozi a mbari ya Juda na ya Benjamini, alavyadzi-sadaka, Alawi na atu ambao Mwenyezi Mlungu waatiya msukumo wa kpwendadzenga, adzitayarisha kpwendadzenga luphya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu iriyo hiko Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu osi ariosagala nao pande zosi aaterya na miyo ya feza, zahabu, vitu, mifugo na vitu vya samani, mbali na vira vyolaviwa kama sadaka ya hiyari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalume Koreshi wavilavya vitu vya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, ambavyo Nebukadineza kala akavitsamiza kula Jerusalemu na kuviika ndani ya nyumba ya milunguye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Koreshi mfalume wa Pashia wamlagiza Mithiredathi, muiki wa hazina, ambaye waviolanga na achimupha Sheshibaza, chilongozi wa Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ihi ndiyo jumula ya vitu hivyo, mabakuli makulu mirongo mihahu ga zahabu, mabakuli elufu mwenga ga feza na marumu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Marumu",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "au vyetezo. Neno ra Chieburania ririrohumika hipha manaye taiwazi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ganjina mirongo miiri na tisiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mabakuli mirongo mihahu ga zahabu, mabakuli magana mane na kumi ga feza na miyo yanjina elufu mwenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miyo yosi ya zahabu na feza yakala elufu tsano magana mane. Wakati atu ariohalwa mateka ariphokala anatuluka Babeli, Sheshibaza wahala miyo hino yosi achiuya nayo Jerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
